Output     : apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/GlancePage/
             (repo convention = C#-markup feature-views, not Features/*.xaml; see sibling
              done pages DashboardPage/QuickStatsPage/EnergyProductsPage)
Nav        : apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/Shell/ShellWindow.xaml.cs — PageFactory.Register("Glance", …)
