Files:
  feature-views/GlancePage/GlancePage.Model.cs      (parsers + projection + registration + diagnostics)
  feature-views/GlancePage/GlancePage.Source.cs     (generated C# client cache-then-network: vehicles+state+location+command)
  feature-views/GlancePage/GlancePage.ViewModel.cs  (INotifyPropertyChanged 4-state holder + ports + empty/default sources)
  feature-views/GlancePage/GlancePage.cs            (WinUI 3 UserControl, Fluent + design tokens — build-only, not headless-linked)
  TeslaSync.App.Tests/FeatureViews/GlancePageTests.cs  (35 headless tests)
  TeslaSync.App.Tests/TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj       (links the 3 UI-free files; the WinUI view is build-only)
  apps/parity/windows-ledger.json                      (page:dashboard/Glance -> done, 30/30)

Data sources (P1/S8 state-holder VM → generated C# client, ADR-004; web hook names kept at the C# call sites):
  useVehicles               -> GlanceVehiclesSource.StreamAsync, ApiRequest(Operations.Vehicles.List = get_api_v1_vehicles)
                               resolves vehicleId ?? vehicles[0] via GlanceVehicle.Resolve
  useVehicleState           -> GlanceVehicleStateSource.StreamAsync(vehicleId),
                               ApiRequest(Operations.Vehicles.State = get_api_v1_vehicles_vehicleID_state)
  useLocationSnapshotLatest -> GlanceLocationSource.StreamAsync(vehicleId),
                               ApiRequest(Operations.Locations.SnapshotLatest = get_api_v1_location_snapshots_latest, vehicle_id=)
  useVehicleCommand         -> GlanceVehicleCommandSender.SendAsync(vehicleId, command),
                               ApiRequest(post_api_v1_vehicles_vehicleID_command, Body { command })
Units (P1/S5): SI read from the API (rated_range metres, inside_temp °C); converted only at the display boundary in
  GlanceProjection via UnitFormatters.FormatDistance/FormatTemperature (no non-SI stored/computed). UnitPref defaults to metric.
Live data: web page polls via TanStack-Query refetchInterval (no useLiveX/SSE); the native VM exposes LoadAsync/RefreshAsync
  and a TsDataFreshness chip (UpdatedAt/IsFetching/IsError) — staleness surfaced through the freshness logic (ADR-013).

