        evidence-test: Location_label_prefers_home_then_work_then_favorite_then_destination
[6/30]  chart  RadialGauge
        GlancePage.cs::BuildGauge — native WinUI ring built from the same W3 chart primitives the TsRadialGauge wrapper
        uses (ChartShapes.ArcPath + ChartGeometry.RingArc/GaugeFraction), value arc tinted by the web batteryColor
        threshold via ChartBrushes.ForStatus(display.BatteryStatus); GlanceProjection BatteryValue/BatteryMax/
        BatteryValueText/BatteryStatus/HasBatteryReading (max=100, "%", "glance.battery" caption).
        evidence-test: Battery_threshold_maps_to_status, Missing_battery_reading_is_neutral
[7/30]  state  loading
        GlanceState.Loading ; GlancePageViewModel.BuildModel(loading) ; GlancePage.cs::BuildLoading (TsSkeleton ring + bars).
        evidence-test: Loading_model_projects_loading_state
[8/30]  state  empty
        GlanceState.Empty (vehicles resolved, no vehicle) ; GlancePage.cs::BuildEmpty (TsEmptyState, glance.noVehicle).
        evidence-test: No_vehicle_projects_empty_state, ViewModel_empty_fleet_sets_empty_state
[9/30]  state  error
        GlanceState.Error ; GlancePageViewModel.ErrorTextFor ; GlancePage.cs::BuildError (TsQueryError + Retry).
        evidence-test: Failed_model_projects_error_state, ViewModel_load_failure_sets_error_state
[10/30] state  success
        GlanceState.Success ; GlancePageViewModel.LoadAsync -> state+location ; GlancePage.cs::BuildSuccess.
        evidence-test: Resolved_vehicle_projects_success_state, ViewModel_load_populates_success_with_state_and_location
